        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Production from bastnaesite concentrate that is converted to its chloride and reduced with fused salt electrolysis. Electrolysis approximated with processes from aluminium industry.\n\n# Included processes\nIncludes the basic raw materials consumed and energy for precipitation reaction, filtration and drying. No direct emissions or infrastructure are included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
